The '''Pigmen's Den''' is the third floor of the {{Zone|Deep Caverns}}. {{Item|Redstone}} can be mined there and {{MobSprite|Zombie Pigman;Zombie Pigmen}} spawn.

{{ZoneText|The &bPigmen's Den&f can now be traveled to via the Lift.|Mine Redstone ore.|Talk to Redstone Miner|Be careful mining Redstone Ore around the Redstone Pigmen!}}

== Features ==
The '''Pigmen's Den''' features a few attractions.

=== Lift Operator ===
{{Main|Lift Operator}}
In front of the lift shaft is the {{NPCSprite|Lift Operator}}, who allows players to teleport between layers of the [[Deep Caverns]] with ease. Once the player has entered the '''Pigmen's Den''' and talked to the [[Lift Operator]], they will be able to teleport to the floor from any other level of the island.

